# Encodes the 20-year unitrust layer: estate deduction about 70.1 percent of its funding.
# It is over the 4947(b)(3)(A) 60 percent line, so 4943 would reach any business it held;
# the page assumes marketable assets.
:S6_30_gift a dm:PlannedGift ;
    dm:giftVehicle dm:FamilyLeadTrust ; dm:deductionAllowed true ; dm:deductionFor dm:IncomeInterest ;
